            appearing as explicit
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/effective+field+theory"} effective
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+%28physics%29"} fields
            (as opposed to emergent
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Skyrmion"} Skyrmion
            fields), as is more generally the case in
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/baryon+chiral+perturbation+theory"} baryon chiral perturbation theory
            %em
